## Verification

- API, worker, frontend, and discovery-agent images use immutable tag `20260831115901`.
- All four Container App updates reached `Succeeded`, and the new revisions reached `Running`.
- The API completed its startup database migration step before becoming available.
- API health endpoint returned `Healthy`.
- Frontend served the DB Migration Assist application instead of the placeholder page.

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    User[Portal user] --> Web[Frontend Container App]
    Web --> API[API Container App]
    API --> PG[(Azure Database for PostgreSQL)]
    Worker[Worker Container App] --> API
    Agent[Discovery Agent Container App] --> API
    ACR[Azure Container Registry] --> Web
    ACR --> API
    ACR --> Worker
    ACR --> Agent
    KV[Azure Key Vault] --> API
    KV --> Worker
```
